{"3816220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WingWhiz", "steam_appid": 3816220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>ABOUT THE GAME</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WingWhiz is a A 3D take on classic top down arcade shooters, combined with roguelite elements. Pick your plane, dodge enemy fire and destroy everything in your path. Level up, choose upgrades and keep building your plane as the run gets more chaotic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>DESTROY EVERYTHING. GET STRONGER</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enemies, turrets and objects around you can all be destroyed. Enemies and certain obstacles break apart with physics and reward you with XP. Fill your XP bar and choose from random upgrades to grow your build. The more you destroy, the faster your build grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c00d296fc2dd845f4480284bd75b0568.poster.avif?t=1788265000\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c00d296fc2dd845f4480284bd75b0568.webm?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c00d296fc2dd845f4480284bd75b0568.mp4?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>CHOOSE YOUR OWN BUILD</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a plane based on its unique strengths, then build around them as you level up during the run. Each plane comes with its own stats, weapons and abilities that push you toward a different playstyle. Pick what fits you, then shape the rest of the build around that choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/ca7aa2e5b79dbac56caf5dd075fb69d7.poster.avif?t=1788265000\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/ca7aa2e5b79dbac56caf5dd075fb69d7.webm?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/ca7aa2e5b79dbac56caf5dd075fb69d7.mp4?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>SOME POWERS COME AT A PRICE</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find mystery boxes throughout your run and break them to reveal random artifacts. Artifacts can completely change your build, giving you something powerful while taking something in return. You decide if the trade is worth it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/dd503ae78881a6e4ef5669782a98ec5b.poster.avif?t=1788265000\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/dd503ae78881a6e4ef5669782a98ec5b.webm?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/dd503ae78881a6e4ef5669782a98ec5b.mp4?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>NEW WORLDS, NEW CHAOS</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world brings its own enemies, attack patterns, hazards and encounters. Keep building your plane until you reach the final boss waiting at the end of the world. Beat bosses, complete challenges and unlock new worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/e9ecb121694a82960f92c3ea94f3424c.poster.avif?t=1788265000\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/e9ecb121694a82960f92c3ea94f3424c.webm?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/e9ecb121694a82960f92c3ea94f3424c.mp4?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>KEEP GETTING STRONGER</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your plane build starts fresh with every run, but your hangar keeps growing. Permanently upgrade your power ups and unlock new planes as you progress. New planes bring their own primary weapons, abilities and playstyles, giving you more ways to build your next run. New planes. New weapons. New builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/3e1a2b1588b1e06f268ac79fffb3f618.poster.avif?t=1788265000\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/3e1a2b1588b1e06f268ac79fffb3f618.webm?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/3e1a2b1588b1e06f268ac79fffb3f618.mp4?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>ABOUT THE GAME</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WingWhiz is a A 3D take on classic top down arcade shooters, combined with roguelite elements. Pick your plane, dodge enemy fire and destroy everything in your path. Level up, choose upgrades and keep building your plane as the run gets more chaotic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>DESTROY EVERYTHING. GET STRONGER</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enemies, turrets and objects around you can all be destroyed. Enemies and certain obstacles break apart with physics and reward you with XP. Fill your XP bar and choose from random upgrades to grow your build. The more you destroy, the faster your build grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c00d296fc2dd845f4480284bd75b0568.poster.avif?t=1788265000\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c00d296fc2dd845f4480284bd75b0568.webm?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c00d296fc2dd845f4480284bd75b0568.mp4?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>CHOOSE YOUR OWN BUILD</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a plane based on its unique strengths, then build around them as you level up during the run. Each plane comes with its own stats, weapons and abilities that push you toward a different playstyle. Pick what fits you, then shape the rest of the build around that choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/ca7aa2e5b79dbac56caf5dd075fb69d7.poster.avif?t=1788265000\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/ca7aa2e5b79dbac56caf5dd075fb69d7.webm?t=1788265000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar